{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-036",
    "title": "天门之下"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_224",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“你拒绝继承？”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "归墟盟总坛在回川城西南的断崖下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6502,
          "end": 6502
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三人沿山腹石道走了一整夜，才抵达一座被雪覆盖的石门。石门没有守卫，门楣上却刻着一行旧字：改写者先改自己。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6504,
          "end": 6504
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜将白色骨牌嵌进门缝。石门向内开启，露出一间空旷的石厅。石厅中央悬着一座黑色水池，池水没有波纹，池面却倒映着不同年代的天空。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6506,
          "end": 6506
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是归墟盟的归名池。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6508,
          "end": 6508
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“用来做什么？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6510,
          "end": 6510
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“检查名字是否仍属于本人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6512,
          "end": 6512
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临走到池边。池面浮出他的倒影，倒影却没有脸，只有一团青色火焰。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6514,
          "end": 6514
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你的名字已经部分进入天门。”慧闻的声音从石厅入口传来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6516,
          "end": 6516
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜回头：“你也来了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6518,
          "end": 6518
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“无相寺不放心你们。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6520,
          "end": 6520
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还是不放心归墟盟？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6522,
          "end": 6522
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“两者相同。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6524,
          "end": 6524
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主从石厅深处走出。他脱下旧青衫，露出里面刻满细小名字的黑衣。每一个名字都被红线缝过，像有人试图把它们重新缝回身体。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6526,
          "end": 6526
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临，进入归名池。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6528,
          "end": 6528
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不接受测试。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6530,
          "end": 6530
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你想进入总坛，就必须先证明自己没有被天门完全占据。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6532,
          "end": 6532
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果我已经被占据呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6534,
          "end": 6534
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就没有必要进入。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6536,
          "end": 6536
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向顾长离。她点了点头，却把铜针握得更紧。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6538,
          "end": 6538
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他踏入池水。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6540,
          "end": 6540
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "池水没有温度，脚底却传来一阵剧痛。无数名字从水下游过，擦过他的脚踝、膝盖和胸口。每个名字后面都跟着一个陌生人的记忆。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6542,
          "end": 6542
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一个孩子在雪里找灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6544,
          "end": 6544
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一个女人在城门前等人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6546,
          "end": 6546
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一个修士亲手撕掉自己的姓名。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6548,
          "end": 6548
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临越往前走，记忆越沉。他看见自己的倒影从水面裂开，裂缝里露出陆沉舟的脸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6550,
          "end": 6550
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你要结丹。”陆沉舟说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6552,
          "end": 6552
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我已借壳筑基，正在冲击金丹。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6554,
          "end": 6554
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“太虚遗脉会替你跨过境界。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6556,
          "end": 6556
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“代价是什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6558,
          "end": 6558
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你已经知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6560,
          "end": 6560
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我想听你说。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6562,
          "end": 6562
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟伸手按在水面：“每一次借用门的力量，你都会失去一段只属于自己的记忆。不是名字，不是历史，而是让你成为你的那一小部分。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6564,
          "end": 6564
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那我会变成什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6566,
          "end": 6566
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一个记得所有人，却不记得自己为何记得的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6568,
          "end": 6568
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "池水突然沸腾。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6570,
          "end": 6570
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临的气海中，金色裂纹彻底合拢，凝成一枚暗金色的丹丸。丹丸外侧缠着青色纹路，像一扇缩小的门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6572,
          "end": 6572
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主抬手：“金丹成了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6574,
          "end": 6574
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离冲到池边：“他还没准备好！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6576,
          "end": 6576
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“没有人准备好。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6578,
          "end": 6578
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临从池中走出，衣袍滴水未沾。掌心残印已经与两枚石片融合，形成一枚不完整的灰白圆盘。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6580,
          "end": 6580
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我结丹了。”他低声说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6582,
          "end": 6582
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你记得自己为什么要结丹吗？”慧闻问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6584,
          "end": 6584
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临抬头，想起父亲、顾长离、叶观澜和回川城的居民。他知道自己必须变强，却想不起最初那个让他踏上玄霄宗山道的念头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6586,
          "end": 6586
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为了找一个人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6588,
          "end": 6588
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6590,
          "end": 6590
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6592,
          "end": 6592
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他知道答案，却无法把名字说出来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6594,
          "end": 6594
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抓住他的手：“是陆沉舟。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6596,
          "end": 6596
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "名字被她说出，暗金丹丸立刻震动。陆照临胸口一阵剧痛，记忆中那张父亲的脸再次变得模糊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6598,
          "end": 6598
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我记得。”他说，“只是不能自己说。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6600,
          "end": 6600
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主将一块黑色令牌递给他：“金丹之后，你可以进入总坛内层。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6602,
          "end": 6602
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不为归墟盟做事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6604,
          "end": 6604
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不需要为任何人做事。你只需要看见改写权的源头。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6606,
          "end": 6606
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "内层石门打开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6608,
          "end": 6608
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "墙壁上挂着数百份旧盟约，纸张被分成两半，一半写着允许记住的名字，一半写着必须忘记的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6610,
          "end": 6610
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜走到最里面，取下一份残缺盟约。盟约上写着他的祖辈名字，旁边盖着盟主印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6612,
          "end": 6612
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6640,
          "end": 6640
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“北河城在哪里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-081",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6662,
          "end": 6662
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“条件？”叶观澜问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6808,
          "end": 6808
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“让我成为新的门楔。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6810,
          "end": 6810
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "众人同时看向他。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6812,
          "end": 6812
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你要替他们承担？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6814,
          "end": 6814
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我继承了改写权，也继承了改写的债。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6816,
          "end": 6816
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你会失去什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6818,
          "end": 6818
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字、记忆和归墟盟。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6820,
          "end": 6820
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜握紧刀：“不行。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6822,
          "end": 6822
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不是盟主。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6824,
          "end": 6824
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可我是叶观澜。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6826,
          "end": 6826
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他抬刀劈向黑色令牌。令牌裂成两半，归墟盟主的脸色第一次变得难看。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6828,
          "end": 6828
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你拒绝继承？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6830,
          "end": 6830
        }
      }
    ],
